{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>Arise</b> — the prayer of the psalmist, or he speaks in the voice of those who cry out against violence, or by way of prophecy." "<b>And the bet in בכל הגוים</b> — added, like: לכו לחמו בלחמי (come, eat of my bread), and the action will issue in the manner of: ונחלתנו ונחל ה' את יהודה חלקו (and our inheritance — and HaShem will inherit Judah as his portion). And R. Judah HaLevi said: you will be an inheritance to those who cry out among all the nations."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 82, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:35:51.215750978Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}